From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 03:39:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] fix(yocv): Back to the listing is Yoma blue with purple
 text

The team decided that every prototype's Continue or Back button in the
connected journey is Yoma blue #4cade9 with Yoma purple #41204b text.
YoCV's Back to the listing had ink text, and white on darker blue on
hover.

- styles.css: purple text (--accent, 5.5:1 on the blue); the hover only
  brightens the blue, as SkillLens does.
- Test first in tests/cv-connected-journey.test.cjs.
- Spec section 6 records the decision.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YcQNX4S5GbGG8rboP8226e
